{"type": "sena", "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn8le05ob04re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn8le05ob04re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn8le05ob04re2img01.jpg", "text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0"}, {"image": "engenn8le05ob04re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Jose</span>:\t\tThank you, Frank, for agreeing to train me before my first shift.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Frank</span>:\t\tThat is no problem at all, Jose. We've all been there before, and I know how overwhelming new environments can be.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jose</span>:\t\tYes. I am getting used to the way people behave here compared to in my country. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Frank</span>:\t\tOh yeah? What differences have you noticed?", "id": 1, "time": "100"}, {"image": "engenn8le05ob04re2img02.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Jose</span>:\t\tFor example, I found that no one really stares at you here when they speak. Where I come from, it's very common to stare at anybody.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Frank</span>:\t\tI see ... Well, it's something that people find very rude here. You won't obtain any favors from anyone that way, especially from our customers! It puts a strain on the relationship between the waiter and the customers.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jose</span>:\t\tHow do we stain them? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Frank</span>:\t\t Strain, not stain. You stain something when it becomes dirty. A strain means a great effort to do something.", "id": 2, "time": "18200"}, {"image": "engenn8le05ob04re2img03.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Jose</span>:\t\tThank you. Sometimes I need people to explain some words to me.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Frank</span>:\t\tThat's fine. I think you're doing great! Your English is not bad at all.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jose</span>:\t\tI'm taking evening classes on my days off.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Frank</span>:\t\tThat's a good idea. In any case, you don't need to speak like a professor to get started. It's better to communicate in plain sentences at first. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jose</span>:\t\tHopefully the customers will understand. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Frank</span>:\t\tAlways repeat their order to ascertain that you got it right!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jose</span>:\t\tAscertain?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Frank</span>:\t\tIt means making sure of something.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Jose</span>: \t\tThanks, Frank. You are a walking dictionary!", "id": 3, "time": "51000"}]}}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can talk about manners and customs.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can use and pronounce words like train.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can stress new information.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " Have you ever started something as a complete beginner? What was it?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " Which profession requires a lot of training? Why?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": " Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "Pronunciation Spot: It's better to explain things clearly when you want to train someone!", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "img_path": "", "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"typ